@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"大叔我们是因为<br>听到现场房间那边<br>传来了<link=\"Objection_02_01_05_03\">声响</link><br>才过去的。|#0201Trial05_Miria001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

